<title>UK: BayerVB unit sets 400 mln Danish crown 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB unit sets 400 mln Danish crown 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK O/S FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON    *5.0 PCT   MATURITY    20.NOV.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.10    PAY DATE    20.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO YEAR FOUR, 8.25 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.375</p>
